From d1ebcb939514150fa783d10562ff16f85114c7f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pokeplatinum-3ds <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 09:27:13 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Declare functions the game calls without a declaration
 (SDK_PORT_3DS)

Metrowerks compiled calls to functions with no declaration in scope; GCC 14
rejects them. Every function is defined in the game: add the missing
prototypes to their headers, include the header that already declares them,
or include <stdlib.h> for abs(). link_contest_records.h shares contest.h's
include guard, so contest.c, which includes both, never sees it; declare the
one function contest.c needs there. The original build is unchanged.
